title: "stigmergic-dev-runtime: an evaluator-gated stigmergic software evolution runtime"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
authors:
  - name: "stigmergic-dev-runtime maintainers"
abstract: >-
  Research runtime and reproducible benchmark for evaluator-gated stigmergic
  software evolution: finite-lived AI workers accumulate capability through
  versioned executable artifacts, lineage, evidence, and failure records,
  without persistent conversational identity.
keywords:
  - stigmergy
  - software evolution
  - language-model agents
  - reproducibility
